WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.740 --> 00:00:02.600
- [Narrator] It's been two
weeks since we last visited

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:04.900
the service dogs in
training of Doggy Do Good,

00:00:05.290 --> 00:00:07.700
which means it's been two
weeks since I've seen Kaya,

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:09.963
which means we're going to
look at her for a second.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:13.500
Man, she's the best.

00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:16.423
But today's not Kaya's big day.

00:00:16.790 --> 00:00:17.703
It's Demian's.

00:00:18.670 --> 00:00:21.113
Today is his final exam.

00:00:21.990 --> 00:00:25.383
If he passes, Demian will go
to his forever family tomorrow.

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:27.700
If he flunks the test, however,

00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:29.850
it could mean months
before Demian is ready

00:00:30.170 --> 00:00:32.863
or the family may need to
find a different service dog.

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:34.550
Good luck, buddy.

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:37.067
This is what you puppy prepped for.

00:00:38.112 --> 00:00:40.695
(upbeat music)

00:01:07.925 --> 00:01:09.864
For Demian's final exam, the trainers

00:01:09.950 --> 00:01:12.050
at Doggy Do Good have chosen a local mall.

00:01:13.343 --> 00:01:16.010
(playful music)

00:01:16.330 --> 00:01:19.080
With slick floors, steep stairs

00:01:19.440 --> 00:01:23.070
and distractions aplenty,
only the truly ready pups

00:01:23.070 --> 00:01:25.570
can get through all of
their drills without issue.

00:01:27.280 --> 00:01:29.060
Before going inside, it's time

00:01:29.060 --> 00:01:31.360
for some warm up drills
by the parking garage.

00:01:32.920 --> 00:01:35.070
Places you and I wouldn't
think twice about

00:01:35.290 --> 00:01:37.813
are sometimes perfect
places to test the pups.

00:01:38.650 --> 00:01:40.583
For instance, this grate.

00:01:42.660 --> 00:01:45.613
Unfamiliar surfaces like
these can distract a dog,

00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:47.253
seemingly without explanation.

00:01:48.290 --> 00:01:49.450
Grates can also be the source

00:01:49.450 --> 00:01:51.393
of confusing smells and sounds,

00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:53.350
further throwing a dog off it's game.

00:01:55.110 --> 00:01:56.573
First up, Luke.

00:01:57.290 --> 00:02:00.240
The eight month old golden has
been a model student so far.

00:02:00.270 --> 00:02:02.110
A simple steel grate won't bother...

00:02:03.560 --> 00:02:04.393
Oh.

00:02:07.590 --> 00:02:08.423
How 'bout that?

00:02:09.190 --> 00:02:12.053
His tail wags but Luke can't
wait to get off the metal.

00:02:13.850 --> 00:02:16.513
You can see his hesitation
as he continues to cross.

00:02:16.870 --> 00:02:19.493
The sound and moving surface confuses him.

00:02:19.720 --> 00:02:21.280
We may think it's a silly fear

00:02:21.480 --> 00:02:24.080
but it's a good reminder
that Luke is still a puppy.

00:02:26.120 --> 00:02:27.410
Karen makes the golden pause

00:02:27.410 --> 00:02:29.110
on the grate and feeds him treats.

00:02:29.550 --> 00:02:31.030
Hopefully, this will get him to fear

00:02:31.030 --> 00:02:32.293
the grate a little less.

00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:35.670
After a few more back and forths,

00:02:35.740 --> 00:02:37.090
Luke gets more comfortable.

00:02:38.030 --> 00:02:39.123
This is good.

00:02:39.310 --> 00:02:41.880
At this stage, Luke just
needs to show progress

00:02:41.880 --> 00:02:43.343
towards overcoming his fears,

00:02:43.660 --> 00:02:45.610
even for something as small as a grate.

00:02:47.580 --> 00:02:49.200
With Luke scared of the grate,

00:02:49.200 --> 00:02:50.630
it could mean his sister, Kaya,

00:02:50.630 --> 00:02:52.193
inherited a similar fear.

00:02:54.700 --> 00:02:55.533
Nope.

00:02:55.640 --> 00:02:56.930
The eight month old crosses the metal

00:02:56.930 --> 00:02:58.403
with grace and poise.

00:02:59.020 --> 00:02:59.963
Well done, Kaya.

00:03:00.460 --> 00:03:02.310
Way to show your brother what's what.

00:03:03.710 --> 00:03:06.390
Next, it's time for Luke
and Kaya's half sister,

00:03:06.390 --> 00:03:07.713
Remmy, to cross the grate.

00:03:08.410 --> 00:03:10.420
The trainers are curious
to see if she'll be brave,

00:03:10.420 --> 00:03:12.763
like her sister, or
scared, like her brother.

00:03:15.470 --> 00:03:17.320
With that stutter step,
it looks like Remmy

00:03:17.320 --> 00:03:19.433
is the exact average of her siblings,

00:03:19.970 --> 00:03:21.270
not as frightened as Luke,

00:03:21.420 --> 00:03:23.383
but definitely more cautious than Kaya.

00:03:24.780 --> 00:03:27.373
Still, she's more curious than scared,

00:03:27.690 --> 00:03:29.490
a good sign for the eight month old.

00:03:30.730 --> 00:03:33.273
With the goldens done,
it's Benelli's turn.

00:03:34.090 --> 00:03:36.310
Only two weeks ago, the six month old

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:38.360
completely shut down at the bus station.

00:03:38.900 --> 00:03:41.050
If she has a similar
reaction to the grate,

00:03:41.160 --> 00:03:43.510
it could spell disaster
for the lab's chances

00:03:43.510 --> 00:03:44.560
of staying in school.

00:03:46.520 --> 00:03:48.820
But Benelli handles the
grate like a champion.

00:03:48.900 --> 00:03:51.200
She stands still and even
keeps her tail wagging

00:03:51.200 --> 00:03:52.800
when Paul tries to distract her.

00:03:54.490 --> 00:03:56.720
The puppy's made huge
strides in her courage

00:03:56.720 --> 00:03:58.790
the last two weeks, exactly what

00:03:58.790 --> 00:04:00.240
the trainers needed from her.

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:07.800
The other puppy with bravery issues

00:04:07.890 --> 00:04:10.273
is our man about town, Mr. Pip.

00:04:11.966 --> 00:04:14.930
Though he hesitates, the Yorkshire terrier

00:04:14.930 --> 00:04:16.393
has little say in the matter.

00:04:16.710 --> 00:04:18.460
When a trainer can pick
you up and move you

00:04:18.460 --> 00:04:20.670
wherever she sees fit, you're gonna have

00:04:20.670 --> 00:04:21.723
to face your demons.

00:04:24.200 --> 00:04:26.000
Mr. Pip is presented with a dilemma,

00:04:26.560 --> 00:04:29.050
satisfy his unshakable craving for treats

00:04:29.300 --> 00:04:30.963
or flee like a coward.

00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:34.213
Again, Karen makes his decision for him.

00:04:37.120 --> 00:04:40.060
Good enough, Mr. Pip, your
strengths lie elsewhere

00:04:40.400 --> 00:04:41.593
and that's just fine.

00:04:44.950 --> 00:04:47.333
Finally, it's Demian's turn.

00:04:48.770 --> 00:04:50.270
Even with a pack in his mouth,

00:04:50.280 --> 00:04:52.530
this is more of a
formality than a real test,

00:04:53.040 --> 00:04:55.010
Like a senior taking an introductory class

00:04:55.010 --> 00:04:56.260
that he forgot he needed.

00:04:58.230 --> 00:04:59.930
The yellow lab doesn't disappoint.

00:05:00.320 --> 00:05:03.083
Demian knows he has to
deliver and he does just that.

00:05:03.690 --> 00:05:05.983
His real test awaits him inside the mall.

00:05:10.710 --> 00:05:11.563
Noises.

00:05:12.480 --> 00:05:13.313
People.

00:05:13.770 --> 00:05:14.603
Food.

00:05:15.140 --> 00:05:16.823
Deals, deals, deals.

00:05:17.560 --> 00:05:19.810
The dogs need to overcome
all these distractions

00:05:19.810 --> 00:05:21.060
and more inside the mall.

00:05:22.140 --> 00:05:24.340
The pups go into down-stay
at the food court

00:05:25.290 --> 00:05:27.610
and while Luke naps, Benelli begins

00:05:27.610 --> 00:05:29.033
the mall obstacle course.

00:05:29.720 --> 00:05:32.173
The first challenge, the stairs.

00:05:32.670 --> 00:05:35.963
This mall has very
slippery, very steep stairs.

00:05:37.010 --> 00:05:40.390
Already the floppiest puppy,
Benelli immediately has issues

00:05:44.200 --> 00:05:46.500
but with her tail wagging,
she's a good sport.

00:05:48.550 --> 00:05:50.350
Benelli has to resist her natural urge

00:05:50.350 --> 00:05:51.713
to sprint up the stairs.

00:05:52.300 --> 00:05:55.713
A heel is a heel even with
uneven, slippery footing.

00:05:57.460 --> 00:05:59.163
That's it, Benelli, almost there.

00:06:01.858 --> 00:06:03.880
Oh, okay, good, good.

00:06:03.880 --> 00:06:04.713
Good girl.

00:06:05.580 --> 00:06:07.243
She's just so floppy.

00:06:10.690 --> 00:06:13.803
Now upstairs, Benelli
practices her get it command.

00:06:18.610 --> 00:06:20.910
Even with the lights and
sounds of the arcade,

00:06:22.130 --> 00:06:24.280
Benelli keeps checking
in with her trainer.

00:06:24.610 --> 00:06:27.063
This shows great progress
in Benelli's focus.

00:06:29.700 --> 00:06:31.623
As Benelli returns to the food court,

00:06:32.640 --> 00:06:34.290
it's Kaya's turn around the mall.

00:06:39.920 --> 00:06:43.033
I challenge you to find me
a more perfect dog anywhere.

00:06:44.290 --> 00:06:45.573
It simply can't be done.

00:06:47.830 --> 00:06:49.720
Even amongst the charms of the arcade,

00:06:49.720 --> 00:06:51.083
our girl can't be fazed.

00:06:54.420 --> 00:06:57.793
Kaya is even comfortable lying
down inside a video game.

00:07:02.560 --> 00:07:06.183
On her way back downstairs,
Kaya is patient and attentive,

00:07:06.557 --> 00:07:08.657
exactly what her trainers are looking for.

00:07:13.610 --> 00:07:15.503
As Luke drifts in and out of sleep,

00:07:15.630 --> 00:07:17.030
he wonders if it's his turn.

00:07:17.930 --> 00:07:18.763
Nope.

00:07:19.260 --> 00:07:20.163
Mr. Pip's up.

00:07:20.850 --> 00:07:21.893
Back to sleep.

00:07:23.350 --> 00:07:25.000
The stairs that Benelli struggled with

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:27.350
are a piece of cake for
the undeniable Mr. Pip.

00:07:29.600 --> 00:07:32.513
He scales them like a mountain
climber summits a peak.

00:07:37.580 --> 00:07:40.833
In the arcade, Mr. Pip
practices his comfort drills.

00:07:41.180 --> 00:07:43.150
He'll be going to a family with children

00:07:43.150 --> 00:07:45.500
and if they call upon him
amongst the lights and sounds

00:07:45.500 --> 00:07:47.813
of an amusement hall,
he'll have to perform.

00:07:51.140 --> 00:07:52.503
Before leaving the arcade,

00:07:52.620 --> 00:07:54.690
Mr. Pip obliges a quick photo request

00:07:54.690 --> 00:07:56.690
in the comforts of the motor coach ride.

00:07:59.880 --> 00:08:02.430
Like any brave mountaineer
who conquers a pinnacle,

00:08:02.640 --> 00:08:04.713
what goes pup must come down.

00:08:05.560 --> 00:08:07.763
Imagine if stairs were as big as you are.

00:08:08.080 --> 00:08:09.780
Our brave Mr. Pip doesn't have to.

00:08:10.250 --> 00:08:13.493
He's step-sized and he handles
the challenge with a plum.

00:08:19.470 --> 00:08:21.600
In the arcade, Luke works on some drills

00:08:24.370 --> 00:08:26.080
but it appears some of the distractions

00:08:26.080 --> 00:08:28.830
might be a bit too much for
the eight month old golden.

00:08:29.020 --> 00:08:31.320
When trainer Karen puts
the pup in a down-stay

00:08:32.028 --> 00:08:34.478
to familiarize him with
the stimuli, Luke rebels.

00:08:36.180 --> 00:08:37.640
Luke's future owners need him

00:08:37.640 --> 00:08:39.800
to be all right in a down-stay anywhere

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:42.740
so if he can't become
comfortable in this arcade,

00:08:42.770 --> 00:08:45.470
it could mean a big problem
for his training progress.

00:08:47.880 --> 00:08:49.463
Luke breaks another down-stay.

00:08:55.770 --> 00:08:58.413
Eventually, with Karen
in constant eyesight,

00:08:58.790 --> 00:08:59.783
Luke is all right.

00:09:01.350 --> 00:09:03.300
After the confinement of the down-stay,

00:09:03.400 --> 00:09:05.020
the golden retriever's more than happy

00:09:05.020 --> 00:09:06.670
to practice his pressure therapy.

00:09:09.120 --> 00:09:10.670
Luke returns to the food court.

00:09:11.290 --> 00:09:14.240
It's been an uncharacteristically
shaky day for the golden.

00:09:14.700 --> 00:09:17.283
Like people, service dogs
have good days and bad.

00:09:18.120 --> 00:09:19.430
At the end of their training,

00:09:19.430 --> 00:09:22.380
the hope will be to have as
few days like this as possible.

00:09:28.460 --> 00:09:31.543
One dog who's had some
bad days lately is Remmy.

00:09:32.260 --> 00:09:34.460
It appears, however, she's
made great improvement

00:09:34.460 --> 00:09:35.410
the last few weeks.

00:09:36.770 --> 00:09:38.290
She's checking in with trainer Paul

00:09:38.290 --> 00:09:39.640
and doing well in her heel.

00:09:41.420 --> 00:09:43.330
Even in the arcade, the eight month old

00:09:43.330 --> 00:09:46.110
is attentive and focused,
not at all like she was

00:09:46.110 --> 00:09:47.560
at the beach a few weeks ago.

00:09:50.870 --> 00:09:52.370
And like her half sister, Kaya,

00:09:52.370 --> 00:09:55.320
Remmy is prepared to work inside
of the video game console,

00:09:55.400 --> 00:09:57.903
giving Paul hugs amongst
the frightening zombies.

00:10:01.030 --> 00:10:03.300
On the stairs, Remmy shows patience

00:10:03.300 --> 00:10:05.163
that was totally absent a week ago.

00:10:05.780 --> 00:10:08.533
She's maturing, a wonderful
sign for her schooling.

00:10:16.060 --> 00:10:18.393
Demian's been training years for this.

00:10:19.150 --> 00:10:21.080
If he passes, tomorrow morning,

00:10:21.080 --> 00:10:23.830
he and trainer Paul will set
off to his forever family.

00:10:24.900 --> 00:10:27.640
If he fails, it doesn't look good

00:10:27.640 --> 00:10:29.340
for Demian's continued enrollment.

00:10:29.544 --> 00:10:31.270
- All right, Demian, let's go.

00:10:31.270 --> 00:10:32.830
- [Narrator] Demian's
classmates wish him luck

00:10:32.830 --> 00:10:33.873
as he sets off.

00:10:36.510 --> 00:10:38.913
First challenge, the stairs.

00:10:40.270 --> 00:10:42.470
While the younger puppies
could slip around,

00:10:42.500 --> 00:10:44.040
Demian's future owners will depend

00:10:44.040 --> 00:10:46.093
on him being steady whenever called upon.

00:10:46.770 --> 00:10:49.113
Tolerance for sliding is almost nill.

00:10:51.010 --> 00:10:52.683
Making it even more difficult,

00:10:52.980 --> 00:10:55.763
Paul applies periodic
pressure to Demian's harness,

00:10:55.930 --> 00:10:58.680
ensuring the lab is ready to
accept his owner's weight.

00:10:59.340 --> 00:11:02.963
Still, Demian is able to
match Paul's pace perfectly,

00:11:03.390 --> 00:11:05.790
even when it gets awkward
for the pup's footing.

00:11:06.890 --> 00:11:09.870
Step by step, Demian proves his patience

00:11:09.870 --> 00:11:11.543
and dependability on the stairs.

00:11:12.510 --> 00:11:14.210
The first part of his test is over

00:11:14.540 --> 00:11:16.123
and so far, so good.

00:11:17.600 --> 00:11:18.433
What's this?

00:11:18.433 --> 00:11:19.266
A pop quiz?

00:11:19.266 --> 00:11:20.633
In the middle of an exam?

00:11:21.450 --> 00:11:22.700
Paul's dropped his wallet

00:11:23.620 --> 00:11:25.620
but Demian retrieves it with no problem.

00:11:29.610 --> 00:11:32.060
Now Demian will have to
carry the trainer's pack.

00:11:32.350 --> 00:11:34.440
Though he did well with
this earlier in the day,

00:11:34.440 --> 00:11:36.530
consistency is the key to graduation

00:11:37.360 --> 00:11:38.883
and our guy is steady.

00:11:42.540 --> 00:11:44.838
Back at down-stay, the
puppies wait nervously,

00:11:44.838 --> 00:11:46.663
rooting for their friend's success.

00:11:47.670 --> 00:11:50.783
It's all right, Mr. Pip, so
far, Demian's doing great.

00:11:53.130 --> 00:11:55.840
A quick trip through the arcade
was no problem for Demian

00:11:55.840 --> 00:11:58.513
so it's on to the next
challenge, stability.

00:11:59.480 --> 00:12:01.483
Paul gives Demian the command, steady,

00:12:01.700 --> 00:12:04.003
then uses the dog to help him sit down.

00:12:04.640 --> 00:12:06.520
With his tail wagging, it's clear

00:12:06.520 --> 00:12:09.693
to see Demian's happy to
work, another great signal.

00:12:11.440 --> 00:12:14.533
Paul uses Demian to help stand,
just as a child runs past.

00:12:15.290 --> 00:12:18.510
Demian maintains his focus,
the exact reaction he needs

00:12:18.510 --> 00:12:20.910
were the same to happen
with his forever family.

00:12:21.640 --> 00:12:24.140
Paul makes a minor adjustment
to Demian's position

00:12:24.290 --> 00:12:26.540
but appears happy with
the dog's performance.

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:32.590
A second stability test is
meant to see Demian's transition

00:12:32.590 --> 00:12:35.693
from a down-stay and he
handles it flawlessly.

00:12:40.350 --> 00:12:42.713
Now, a new challenge just for Demian,

00:12:43.400 --> 00:12:44.563
women's clothing.

00:12:45.520 --> 00:12:48.270
With pack in mouth, Demian
has to show patience

00:12:48.270 --> 00:12:50.620
and focus amongst the
new smells and sights

00:12:51.450 --> 00:12:53.400
and it's no problem for the yellow lab.

00:12:54.090 --> 00:12:56.730
In a simple heel, Demian moves confidently

00:12:56.730 --> 00:12:58.706
and checks in with his handler, the model

00:12:58.706 --> 00:13:00.343
of a great service dog.

00:13:01.530 --> 00:13:04.643
He's in the home stretch but
there's one challenge left,

00:13:05.360 --> 00:13:06.913
going down the stairs.

00:13:07.840 --> 00:13:10.473
Providing stability,
while facing downstairs,

00:13:10.510 --> 00:13:13.260
is the toughest thing Demian
will be called upon to do.

00:13:14.100 --> 00:13:18.053
He has to show patience,
poise, focus and strength,

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:20.430
all while resisting his natural urge

00:13:20.430 --> 00:13:21.943
to bolt down to even footing.

00:13:23.840 --> 00:13:27.680
The slow pace is grueling
but when trainer Paul

00:13:27.680 --> 00:13:30.673
sees Demian wait patiently
on even the last step,

00:13:31.830 --> 00:13:33.133
it appears he's nailed it.

00:13:33.500 --> 00:13:36.150
Not even Paul can contain
his excitement for the pup.

00:13:38.990 --> 00:13:41.020
While Demian turned in
a virtuoso performance

00:13:41.020 --> 00:13:44.257
on his exam, the trainers
still have to discuss if,

00:13:44.257 --> 00:13:46.443
after two years and a name change,

00:13:47.036 --> 00:13:49.103
he's finally ready to graduate.

00:13:50.241 --> 00:13:51.810
(dog barking)

00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:54.820
Back at Doggy Do Good,
Demian's classmates wait

00:13:54.820 --> 00:13:55.763
to hear his fate.

00:13:58.380 --> 00:13:59.963
The tension is palpable.

00:14:02.470 --> 00:14:04.533
Then, they see him.

00:14:05.810 --> 00:14:06.673
He's done it.

00:14:07.010 --> 00:14:09.853
Presenting the newest
graduate from Doggy Do Good,

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:12.453
Demian, the two year old yellow lab.

00:14:13.500 --> 00:14:15.310
Tomorrow, he and Paul will set off

00:14:15.310 --> 00:14:16.960
to meet the lab's forever family.

00:14:17.410 --> 00:14:19.510
Just as Demian was trained to help people,

00:14:19.710 --> 00:14:22.460
now his family will have to
trained in handling Demian.

00:14:22.740 --> 00:14:25.390
The process can take anywhere
from one to three weeks

00:14:25.430 --> 00:14:27.730
but Paul will be there
to help the whole time.

00:14:29.550 --> 00:14:31.540
It's been a long two years of training

00:14:31.810 --> 00:14:33.663
and Demian is rightly excited.

00:14:34.140 --> 00:14:35.890
He takes a well deserved victory lap

00:14:35.890 --> 00:14:37.263
as his classmates look on.

00:14:40.160 --> 00:14:41.770
Their schooling has just begun

00:14:42.330 --> 00:14:43.740
but if they keep up the progress

00:14:43.740 --> 00:14:45.240
they've shown this last month,

00:14:45.440 --> 00:14:48.473
maintain focus and stop
eating so much grass,

00:14:48.631 --> 00:14:50.453
like the newest alum, Demian,

00:14:50.960 --> 00:14:54.720
they too will soon graduate Puppy Prep.

